            "text": "{\"body\":{\"filmDetails\":{\"id\":\"ho00014889\",\"name\":\"Dhamaal 4 (Hindi)\",\"originalName\":\"Dhamaal 4 (Hindi)\",\"length\":143,\"posterLink\":\"https://regalcdn.azureedge.net/CW/Dhamaal4Hindi/HO00014889/TV_SmallPosterImage/20260707-121735961.jpg\",\"posterLinkLarge\":\"https://regalcdn.azureedge.net/CW/Dhamaal4Hindi/HO00014889/TV_LargePosterImage/20260707-121735961.jpg\",\"videoLink\":null,\"link\":\"https://www.cineworld.co.uk/films/dhamaal-4-hindi/ho00014889\",\"weight\":0,\"releaseYear\":\"2026\",\"releaseCountry\":null,\"cast\":\"Ritesh Deshmukh, Ajay Devgn, Esha Gupta, Jaaved Jaaferi, Sanjay Mishra, Arshad Warsi, Ravi Kishan, Sanjeeda Shaikh, Upendra Limaye, Anjali Anand, Vijay Patkar\",\"directors\":\"Indra Kumar\",\"synopsis\":\"The ‘Dhamaal’ boys are back and ready to chase the \\\"Treasure of Life,\\\" facing crazy challenges along the way. What starts as a treasure hunt quickly turns into a rollercoaster of hilarious misadventures.\",\"dateStarted\":\"2026-07-10T00:00:00\",\"eventCount\":230,\"categoriesAttributes\":[\"comedy\",\"drama\"],\"categoryIds\":null,\"screeningAttributes\":[\"2d\",\"hindi\",\"laser\",\"reserved-selected\",\"subbed\",\"superscreen\"],\"ageRestrictionId\":null,\"ageRestrictionLink\":\"https://www.cineworld.co.uk/xmedia/img/10108/rating/12A.png\",\"ageRestrictionName\":\"12a\",\"ageRestrictionDescription\":null,\"showingType\":\"SHOWING\",\"dubbedLanguage\":[],\"firstSubbedLanguage\":[],\"secondSubbedLanguage\":[],\"originalLanguage\":[],\"contentLabels\":[],\"mediaList\":[{\"type\":\"Image\",\"subType\":\"TV_TopShelfPosterImage\",\"url\":\"https://regalcdn.azureedge.net/CW/Dhamaal4Hindi/HO00014889/TV_TopShelfPosterImage/20260707-121735961.jpg\",\"dimensionHeight\":\"608\",\"dimensionWidth\":\"404\"},{\"type\":\"Image\",\"subType\":\"TV_SmallPosterImage\",\"url\":\"https://regalcdn.azureedge.net/CW/Dhamaal4Hindi/HO00014889/TV_SmallPosterImage/20260707-121735961.jpg\",\"dimensionHeight\":\"376\",\"dimensi